  "description": "The House That Dirt Built is the second studio album by English rock band The Heavy. It was released on 5 October 2009. The title is a reference to the nursery rhyme This Is the House That Jack Built. Vocalist Kelvin Swaby explained in an interview with Songfacts that the song \"Sixteen\" was inspired by a time when he was working a lot as a DJ and he would see 16-year-old kids sneaking into clubs.",
